src/fmath.rs ports Go's math package (pow.go, exp_amd64.s, log_amd64.s: Pow as amd64 with FMA
computes it), Copyright 2009 The Go Authors, under the licence above.

src/vp8enc (the VP8 key frame encoder) ports libwebp, BSD-3-Clause, copyright Google Inc.: the
boolean writer (src/utils/bit_writer_utils.c), the header and mode writers (src/enc/syntax_enc.c,
tree_enc.c), quantisation, rate-distortion search and trellis (src/enc/quant_enc.c,
src/dsp/cost.c, src/enc/cost_enc.c), segment analysis (src/enc/analysis_enc.c), the token loop
and probability finalisation (src/enc/frame_enc.c, token_enc.c, filter_enc.c), the forward
transforms (src/dsp/enc.c) and the RGB to YUV conversion (src/enc/picture_csp_enc.c,
src/dsp/yuv.c). Its inverse transforms and intra predictors follow golang.org/x/image/vp8, under
the licence above. Its licence is in LICENSE.libwebp.

src/vp8l (the VP8L encoder for ALPH chunks) ports libwebp 1.2.2, BSD-3-Clause, copyright Google
Inc.: the lossless encoder (src/enc/vp8l_enc.c, backward_references_enc.c,
backward_references_cost_enc.c, histogram_enc.c, predictor_enc.c), its Huffman writer
(src/utils/huffman_encode_utils.c), the entropy helpers and predictors (src/dsp/lossless_enc.c,
lossless.c, lossless_common.h) and the ALPH wrapper and filters (src/enc/alpha_enc.c,
src/utils/filters_utils.c, src/dsp/filters.c). Its clog is Go's math.Log. Its licence is in
LICENSE.libwebp.

src/gosort.rs ports Go's slices.SortFunc (pdqsort, zsortanyfunc.go, Copyright 2009 The Go Authors)
under the licence above, so ties sort as in Go.

src/simd/enc_collect.rs and src/simd/enc_chroma.rs (with their avx2 and neon files) are SIMD forms
of libwebp, BSD-3-Clause, copyright Google Inc.: the segment analysis histogram and alpha
(CollectHistogram_C in src/dsp/enc.c, GetAlpha in src/enc/analysis_enc.c) and the gamma-corrected
2x2 chroma average (src/dsp/yuv.c, src/enc/picture_csp_enc.c). Their licence is in LICENSE.libwebp.

src/simd/enc_cost.rs, enc_pred.rs, enc_i4.rs and enc_block.rs (with their avx2 and neon files) are
SIMD forms of libwebp, BSD-3-Clause, copyright Google Inc.: GetResidualCost (src/dsp/cost.c,
src/enc/cost_enc.c), FTransform, QuantizeBlock and ITransform (src/dsp/enc.c), and the intra
predictors and TTransform (src/dsp/enc.c). Their licence is in LICENSE.libwebp.

src/simd/scalar.rs, src/simd/avx2.rs and src/simd/neon.rs (luma_row) are forms of libwebp,
BSD-3-Clause, copyright Google Inc.: VP8RGBToY (src/dsp/yuv.h), with its coefficients. Their licence
is in LICENSE.libwebp.

src/decode.rs (unfilter) ports libwebp's ALPH unfilters and header checks, BSD-3-Clause, copyright
Google Inc.: HorizontalUnfilter, VerticalUnfilter and GradientUnfilter (src/dsp/filters.c) and
the alpha header checks (src/dec/alpha_dec.c). Its licence is in LICENSE.libwebp.

Where this NOTICE says internal/webp, internal/vp8l, internal/vp8enc, internal/vp8ldec or
internal/vp8dec, the Rust files are src/decode.rs (and riff.rs), src/vp8l, src/vp8enc, src/vp8ldec
and src/vp8dec; the libwebp licence text is in LICENSE.libwebp.

This crate is a Rust port of github.com/dobbo-ca/webp-go (Apache-2.0); the Go source it ports is vendored in tests/parity/go/upstream.
